        "title": "Turn review log adds harness field and empty outcome",
        "summary": "The Axiom-only log schema in common/src/util/axiom-only-log.ts registers a new harness string field on the turn review event to record whether a turn was reviewed on the user's computer via claude-code or codex, and is absent for Freebuff's agent. The outcome field documentation was updated to include empty as a valid value, indicating nothing to suggest. These changes ensure the operational census captures the execution context and distinguishes an empty review from other failure modes.",
        "significance": "minor",
        "audience": "maintainers",
        "evidence": "The diff in common/src/util/axiom-only-log.ts adds the harness field to the TURN_REVIEW_FIELDS allowlist and updates the outcome field's JSDoc comment to include the empty value alongside completed, unrecognized, and failed.",
