        "title": "Add bot-check refusal guard to signup block constants",
        "summary": "Introduced `BOT_CHECK_REFUSALS` in the shared `common` package to isolate the four refusal codes that indicate missing or failed bot-check proofs. Added the `isBotCheckRefusal` type guard to safely narrow untrusted query-string values without casting at call sites. This separates the recoverable bot-check failures, which trigger background recovery in the login flow, from other permanent signup blocks.",
