        "calls": 1,
        "text": "The ad tracking log now includes a new reason for why an ad disappears, specifically when it has been on screen for too long. Because of how these logs are processed, if a new version of the app sends a reason that an older server doesn't recognize, the server simply ignores that one missing detail instead of discarding the entire record. This ensures that timing data about how long an ad was shown is preserved even if parts of the information are new. There is no visible effect on your daily use of the coding assistant; this is a behind-the-scenes update that helps advertisers and the platform understand ad performance without causing errors.",
        "at": "2026-11-14T00:22:41.940Z",
        "src": "e56f73e36d7d"
      }
    },
